hannel</code> and <code>ChannelSelect</code> against plain <code>java.util.function</code> types, so Go-style channels and actors arrive in the same download. It is mutually exclusive with the full Groovy runtime (Gradle enforces that through a shared capability) and warns you at runtime if both jars show up.</p><p>Caveats, because I like you: 6.0 is still in beta, the whole toolkit is marked incubating, and the release notes open with a warning that the material on the page is under development. Nobody should put <code>@ActiveObject</code> in production this quarter. But it is a fair question why the platform needs nine rounds for an API a volunteer project shipped in one.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EXOU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089abf94-37c1-4bc5-9851-e7e7ffa5e856_1000x1120.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EXOU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089abf94-37c1-4bc5-9851-e7e7ffa5e856_1000x1120.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EXOU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089abf94-37c1-4bc5-9851-e7e7ffa5e856_1000x1120.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EXOU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089abf94-37c1-4bc5-9851-e7e7ffa5e856_1000x1120.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EXOU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089abf94-37c1-4